{"version":1,"content":"<p>音樂人伍仲衡今日（19日）在社交網發文，公布聲樂導師梁月玲（Mary老師）離世的消息，他表示：「12日前才探過妳，今天妳突然離開了！</p><p>我哋食過嘅宵夜，一齊做過嘅評判，同你由旺角行到太子， 再由太子行返旺角，妳對我說過每一句鼓勵嘅說話，妳那和藹</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T08:14:06.734017+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T07:33:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T08:07:21.373128+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T08:07:21.373128+00:00","content_hash":"3a8fcb72c244827fb42d8d54e784ba6f54449cdbcf008d7f325c27a1b97164ec","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}